UID:3547301467250833906@strava.com
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261028T190000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261028T200000
DTSTAMP:20261020T231024Z
SUMMARY:LET'S LIFT THE CURFEW - 10k in about an hour
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Sim Buzzard\n\nThis autumn marks the fourth year of L
 et's Lift the Curfew\, the national movement from This Girl Can aiming to e
 nd the curfew imposed on women by safety fears during darker nights.\n\nThi
 s is one of three runs offered by Malvern Buzzards (4.5k\, 6.5k and 10k) al
 l starting together in Priory Park\, Malvern and hopefully arriving back to
 gether at the same time.\n\nThis run will be about 10k and take around an h
 our.\n\nPlease wear BRIGHT\, HI VIZ clothing\, head torches and hopefully N
 EON face paint.\n\nLet's light up Malvern and lift the curfew to open up ru
 nning during the dark nights to as many people as possible.\n\nLIRF: Sim Bu
 zzard [Phone Number Redacted]\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clu
 bs/208705/group_events/3547301467250833906\n\nSynced from Strava Club 20870
 5 on Wed\, 21 Oct @ 12:10 AM
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Leader: Sim BuzzardThis autumn marks the fourt
 h year of Let's Lift the Curfew\, the national movement from This Girl Ca
 n aiming to end the curfew imposed on women by safety fears during darker n
 ights.This is one of three runs offered by Malvern Buzzards (4.5k\, 6.5k an
 d 10k) all starting together in Priory Park\, Malvern and hopefully arrivin
 g back together at the same time.This run will be about 10k and take around
  an hour.Please wear BRIGHT\, HI VIZ clothing\, head torches and hopefully 
 NEON face paint.Let's light up Malvern and lift the curfew to open up runni
 ng during the dark nights to as many people as possible.LIRF: Sim Buzzard [
 Phone Number Redacted]View on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/g
 roup_events/3547301467250833906Synced from Strava Club 208705 on: Wed\, 21 
 Oct @ 12:10 AM
LOCATION:Priory Park
URL:https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3547301467250833906
CATEGORIES:Running,Club Event
END:VEVENT
