SUMMARY:Raise the Curfew about 4.5k
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Sarah Fowkes\n\nThis is part of ‘Lift the Curfew’ a
 nd ‘This Girl Can’ to raise the profile of issues female runners often 
 face. Wear as much high viz and lights as you can to get us noticed. \nThis
  run is aimed at our current and previous TF fledglings and so we shall wal
 k any hills and do about 4.5k in about 40 to 45 minutes.\nWe shall be very 
 sociable and expect some fun! \nNo one left behind!\nAny questions Sarah (r
 un leader) [Phone Number Redacted]\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.co
 m/clubs/208705/group_events/3546549408630764354\n\nSynced from Strava Club 
 208705 on Wed\, 21 Oct @ 12:10 AM
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Leader: Sarah FowkesThis is part of ‘Lift th
 e Curfew’ and ‘This Girl Can’ to raise the profile of issues female r
 unners often face. Wear as much high viz and lights as you can to get us no
 ticed. This run is aimed at our current and previous TF fledglings and so w
 e shall walk any hills and do about 4.5k in about 40 to 45 minutes.We shall
  be very sociable and expect some fun! No one left behind!Any questions Sar
 ah (run leader) [Phone Number Redacted]View on Strava: https://www.strava.c
 om/clubs/208705/group_events/3546549408630764354Synced from Strava Club 208
 705 on: Wed\, 21 Oct @ 12:10 AM
LOCATION:Malvern Hills\, England\, United Kingdom
URL:https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3546549408630764354
CATEGORIES:Running,Club Event
