SUMMARY:Let’s lift the Curfew 6.5km run
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Lily Price\n\nLet’s lift the curfew run \nDress in br
 ight colours\, lights bands and head torches. \n6.5km Road run \nIn about 4
 5 mins \nPlease show your support and join us. \nOn road to make it visible
  to all. \n\nThese events create a powerful visual reminder that women shou
 ld feel able to be active outdoors after dark and that the running communit
 y stands together in support of safer\, more inclusive public spaces. \n\nM
 ore information on let’s lift the curfew runs online \n\nView on Strava: 
 https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3546283429577302064\n\nSyn
 ced from Strava Club 208705 on Wed\, 21 Oct @ 12:10 AM
