 Dress in bright colours\, lights bands and head torches. 6.5km Road run In 
 about 45 mins Please show your support and join us. On road to make it visi
 ble to all. These events create a powerful visual reminder that women shoul
 d feel able to be active outdoors after dark and that the running community
  stands together in support of safer\, more inclusive public spaces. More i
 nformation on let’s lift the curfew runs online View on Strava: https://w
